entries[121411] = { ["name"] = "Crimson Tempest", ["text"] = "45 Energy / 1 to 5 Combo Points\nInstant\nRequires Melee Weapon\nFinishing move that slashes all enemies within 10 yards, causing victims to bleed. Lasts longer per combo point.\n\nDeals extra damage when multiple enemies are afflicted, increasing by 20% per target, up to 100%.\n\nDeals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n\n1 point : [(60% of Attack Power) + (((60% of Attack Power) - (30% of Attack Power)) * (0.5))] over 6 sec\n2 points: [(60% of Attack Power) + (((60% of Attack Power) - (30% of Attack Power)) * (1))] over 8 sec\n3 points: [(60% of Attack Power) + (((60% of Attack Power) - (30% of Attack Power)) * (1.5))] over 10 sec\n4 points: [(60% of Attack Power) + (((60% of Attack Power) - (30% of Attack Power)) * (2))] over 12 sec\n5 points: [(60% of Attack Power) + (((60% of Attack Power) - (30% of Attack Power)) * (2.5))] over 14 sec\n[ 6 points: [(60% of Attack Power) + (((60% of Attack Power) - (30% of Attack Power)) * 3)] over 16 sec] [ Deeper Stratagem : 7 points: [(60% of Attack Power) + (((60% of Attack Power) - (30% of Attack Power)) * 3.5)] over 18 sec ]" }
